## Third-party components

### Pretendard

The typeface bundled with the popup (`ai_agents_usage_monitor/popup/PretendardVariable.woff2`)
is Pretendard by Kil Hyung-jin and contributors, licensed under the SIL Open
Font License, Version 1.1. The full licence and copyright notices ship beside
the font as `Pretendard-OFL.txt`.

The font is redistributed unmodified. The MIT terms above cover this
application's own source; they do not apply to the font.

### NanumSquare Neo

The popup headings and project page use NanumSquare Neo by NAVER Corporation,
licensed under the SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1. The bundled font and full
copyright/license notice are `ai_agents_usage_monitor/popup/NanumSquareNeo.woff2`
and `NanumSquareNeo-OFL.txt`.
Source: https://campaign.naver.com/nanumsquare_neo/

### JetBrains Mono

The project page uses JetBrains Mono by the JetBrains Mono Project Authors,
licensed under the SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1. Its font and full notice
are `assets/JetBrainsMono-Regular.ttf` and `assets/JetBrainsMono-OFL.txt`.

### Fluent UI System Icons

The inline popup icons are from Microsoft's Fluent UI System Icons (16px regular),
Copyright (c) 2020 Microsoft Corporation, licensed under the MIT License.
The full licence text is bundled as `ai_agents_usage_monitor/popup/FluentUI-MIT.txt`.
Source: https://github.com/microsoft/fluentui-system-icons

### Primer Octicons

The GitHub mark linked from the popup and project page is the `mark-github`
Octicon by GitHub, Inc., licensed under the MIT License. The full notice ships
as `ai_agents_usage_monitor/popup/Octicons-MIT.txt`.
Source: https://github.com/primer/octicons
